        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A teacher seeking transfer to another school shall submit a written request to the Superintendent of Schools no later than March 1st of the current year. The teacher shall state the reasons for the request, the school, grade and/or subject to which the teacher seeks transfer. Three (3) choices, in order of preference, if there be preference, shall also be stated. If none of the choices is available then the written request shall be deemed withdrawn.",
            "block_bbox": [
                66,
                583,
                507,
